     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The polite negative past ends in ませんでした.",
     "texto": [
      "ます form → ませんでした to say you didn't do something: 行きませんでした (I didn't go). Don't confuse it with ません, which expresses the negative present/future.",
